  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Never Squeal**: back after 103 archived shows (2122 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1999-07-31** (recommended): source not stated; 33 songs; 182 min [1]\n- **ween1999-07-31.prodigital**: source not stated; 27 songs; 135 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Uploader and friend Chapper (Tom), bonded over Ween, taped this Vail show; it was the first show the uploader taped for real [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1999-07-31**: taped by JKeats/Chapper; transferred by JKeats (2020-03-25); source: AKG480 > Lunatec V2 > M1 [1]. Also: Recorded with AKG480 microphones through Lunatec V2 preamp into an M1; transferred via Tascam DA-20 MKII, USB phono preamp, Audacity to FLAC in March 2020 [1]",
